
C-FOCAL,1969

01.01 T "THEATRICAL MOTION PICTURE PROJECTION LENS SELECTION"!
01.10 T "PROGRAM (NOTE: LIMITED TO 35 AND 70 MM PROJECTORS)"!
01.12 A "WHAT GAGE IS YOUR PROJECTOR IN MILLIMETERS?" A
01.13 I (A-35) 2.1,3.1,4.1

02.10 T "SORRY, THIS PROGRAM IS LIMITED TO 35 AND 70 MM"; G 7.1

03.10 T "IS YOUR THEATER TO USE ITS LENS FOR FLAT OR SCOPE? IF"!
03.20 A "IT IS GOING TO USE SCOPE, TYPE '1'; IF FLAT, TYPE '2'" B
03.30 I (B-2) 3.31,3.5,6.1
03.31 A "HOW FAR IS THE SCREEN FROM THE PROJECTOR IN FEET?" DI
03.32 A "WHAT IS THE WIDTH OF THE SCREEN IN FEET?" WI
03.33 T "THE CORRECT FOCAL LENGTH IS" (2.35)*DI/WI, " INCHES."!
03.34 T "SCREEN HEIGHT MUST BE AT LEAST" (.715)*WI/2.35," FT.";G 7.1
03.50 A "HOW FAR IS THE SCREEN FROM THE PROJECTOR IN FEET?" DN
03.51 A "WHAT IS THE WIDTH OF THE SCREEN IN FEET?" WD
03.52 T "THE CORRECT FOCAL LENGTH IS" (.825)*DN/WD, " INCHES."!
03.53 T "THE SCREEN HEIGHT MUST BE AT LEAST" (.446)*WD/.825, " FT."!
03.54 T "THESE DAYS, YOU'D BETTER CONSIDER GETTING AN"!
03.55 T "ANAMORPHIC SYSTEM!" ; G 7.1

04.10 A "HOW FAR IS THE SCREEN FROM THE PROJECTOR IN FEET?" DT
04.20 A "WHAT IS THE WIDTH OF THE SCREEN IN FEET?" WT
04.30 T "THE CORRECT FOCAL LENGTH IS" (1.913)*DT/WT, " INCHES."!
04.40 T "SCREEN HEIGHT MUST BE AT LEAST" (.868)*WT/1.913, "FT."; G 7.1

06.10 T "SORRY, THE CHOICE IS LIMITED TO FLAT OR SCOPE."

07.10 Q
*`x